to get the same (or even better) result. No more, no less, I said
or intended to say. (My preference would be X->X.)

People who want bones in Sokoban will have enough information to
decide whether they gain anything by Jonadab's original complex
proposal, or whether the outlined simpler approach is much better
feasible. Implementation details have to be considered either way.

